# Model weights are stored in Git LFS.
#
# These are the only three weight formats actually present in the tree, and the
# patterns are deliberately explicit rather than a blanket rule over binaries:
# a catch-all would sweep in icons, captures and fixtures, which belong in Git
# proper where they can be diffed and served without an LFS fetch.
#
#   *.onnx        ONNX graphs — the ArcFace/SCRFD family and the document
#                 detector. Individually up to 167 MB.
#   *.onnx.data   External-tensor sidecar for an ONNX graph too large to inline.
#                 Not matched by *.onnx, which is why it is listed separately.
#   *.pdiparams   PaddlePaddle inference weights for the PP-OCRv5 models.
#
# Several vendored service directories carry their own .gitattributes with
# overlapping rules. Those still apply; this file exists so that coverage does
# not depend on them — the two PaddleOCR weight files under
# reference/extraction-experiments/models/ sat outside every vendored rule and
# were being stored as ~84 MB raw blobs until this was added.
#
# A fresh clone needs `git lfs pull` before the screening service will start.
*.onnx      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.onnx.data filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pdiparams filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
